<BaseLayout
  title="How to Change HOA Management Companies · A Board's 90-Day Transition Guide | Innovia"
  description="A step-by-step guide for HOA boards switching management companies — contract review, RFP, vendor handoff, and the 60–90 day transition timeline. Skip the chaos."
